OL,4,CCHANNELS                               
OL,6,CG2001FBBC Two's on-screen presentation
OL,7,Fis refreshed.                          
OL,9,FBBC Two controller, Jane Root, is      
OL,10,Fpleased with the result: "The new      
OL,11,Fidents, which are a contemporary       
OL,12,Fevolution of the wonderful '2's that   
OL,13,Fhave helped define the channel over the
OL,14,Fpast 10 years, introduce a cleaner and 
OL,15,Fmore modern look to the channel.       
OL,17,F"Viewers connect with the '2's because 
OL,18,Fthey are clever and funny - and        
OL,19,Fenjoyable."                            
